Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.29,0:01:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.97,0:01:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.07,0:01:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.13,0:01:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.51,0:02:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we get into it, there's\Nsomething I want to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.95,0:02:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.97,0:02:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't, you know, kill Vice\NCommander Fanatio, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.85,0:02:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.21,0:02:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's being healed as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.07,0:02:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.25,0:02:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you spared her life, I'll\Nreturn the favor and spare yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.31,0:02:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How disrespectful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.77,0:02:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.03,0:02:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're this high up in the Cathedral,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.65,0:02:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must be the commander\Nof the Integrity Knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.99,0:02:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.90,0:02:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.61,0:02:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.41,0:02:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fanatio isn't the only knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.59,0:02:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eldrie, the four Whirling Blades, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.05,0:02:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.49,0:02:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't they matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.81,0:02:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.19,0:02:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're taking that road.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.23,0:02:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I put this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.39,0:02:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eldrie is Alice's apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.55,0:03:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The four Whirling Blades, Dakira, Jace,\NHolvren, and Jiro, they're Fanatios.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.03,0:03:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.31,0:03:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, she happens to be my apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.05,0:03:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that I don't\Ncare about the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.59,0:03:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just, I'm invested in Aincrad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.33,0:03:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why if you killed her,\NI'd be obliged to avenge her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.07,0:03:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all there is to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.27,0:03:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though, now that I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.41,0:03:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess little Alice does\Nlook up to me as her mentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.11,0:03:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not the same as\Nshe was six years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.61,0:03:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when she first became\Nan apprentice knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.93,0:03:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If me and her went at it now, I\Ndon't know who'd come out on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.81,0:03:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, seeing as how\NAlice is as strong as me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.53,0:03:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must have snuck past her somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you won't be so lucky with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.15,0:03:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,\Nshouldn't there be two of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.03,0:03:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Prime Senator said you had a partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.07,0:03:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess if he's not here with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.31,0:03:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that means he's off somewhere\Nkeeping little Alice busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.57,0:04:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he probably is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.57,0:04:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.01,0:04:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.45,0:04:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm curious to see who will avenge you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.71,0:04:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.27,0:04:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have a mentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.51,0:04:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Norkia style.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lightning Slash.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.07,0:04:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or it's something like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With his sword like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.23,0:04:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll take him an extra move or\Ntwo to activate the technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.45,0:04:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I use the Aincrad-style\NSonic Leap, I can strike him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.89,0:04:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, now that's an interesting stance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.61,0:04:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.41,0:04:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you use combo attacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.41,0:04:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.59,0:04:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.77,0:04:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.39,0:04:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that there was a knight from the\NDark Territory who liked to use him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.29,0:05:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fought him a couple of times before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.71,0:05:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't like the\Nexperience, to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.45,0:05:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My style's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.77,0:05:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doing all them flashy moves\Nis way too complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.61,0:05:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.87,0:05:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to fight like you then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.99,0:05:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using only conventional moves? Hell no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.69,0:05:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to use combo attacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.09,0:05:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.17,0:05:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can handle anything you dish out, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.75,0:05:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should warn you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.15,0:05:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to use my best move\Nfirst, and you ain't ready for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.33,0:05:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If his sword's already in perfect\Ncontrol, then I've only got one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.39,0:05:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As he activates his move,\NI'll attack with Sonic Leap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.33,0:05:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taste the blade of Bercouli Synthesis 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.57,0:05:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On guard! Bercouli?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.87,0:06:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ripple, it's where he just slashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.93,0:06:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oof, talk about cutting it close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.65,0:06:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last thing I expected was for you\Nto come rushing in at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.65,0:06:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.89,0:06:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I damn near killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.23,0:06:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.43,0:06:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But with what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.01,0:06:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was my best move,\Njust like I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.95,0:06:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I took that swing, I\Nwasn't just slicing air.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.37,0:06:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was slicing a moment in\Nthe future, so to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.21,0:06:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slicing the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.69,0:06:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first time I saw a Dark\NKnight use a combo attack
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.19,0:07:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was just after I became an\NIntegrity Knight myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.93,0:07:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sword techniques I\Nlearned were all about putting
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.67,0:07:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as much strength as I could\Nbehind a single strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.31,0:07:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But sword techniques using\Ncombination moves focus
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.69,0:07:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on how to handle your enemy's\Nattacks and land hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.77,0:07:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pretty obvious which is\Nmore practical than a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.93,0:07:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I got beat up\Nreal good, but I survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.27,0:07:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I got to thinking how I could\Nland a hit against a combo user.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.77,0:07:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found the answer with this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.45,0:07:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Originally, it was part of a\Ndivine object called a clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.39,0:07:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It used to hang on the wall\Nof the central cathedral.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.99,0:07:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was here when the world was\Nfirst created, or so I was told.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.43,0:07:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It had a weird name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.57,0:07:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Pontifex called it System\NClock, or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.57,0:07:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When little Alice uses\Nher Osmanthus blade,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.37,0:08:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it cuts through the\Nhorizontal axis of space.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.55,0:08:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But mine cuts the vertical axis of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.85,0:08:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's got a new name,\Nthe Time-Splitting Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.89,0:08:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he swung it, the force\Nof his strike stayed in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.77,0:08:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means I don't have a\Nchance against him up close.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to use long-range attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.89,0:08:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.23,0:08:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Connect armament.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.27,0:08:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Search archive...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.18,0:08:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me guess, you're setting yourself\Nup to attack from a distance, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.55,0:08:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone who sees that move does.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.73,0:08:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same goals for all the Integrity\NKnights that came after me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.23,0:08:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,including Fanatio and Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.83,0:08:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once they saw that move,\Nthey picked long-range,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.51,0:08:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,perfect control to try and deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.15,0:08:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't blame them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.89,0:08:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying to bring me down got to be\Nsort of a contest between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.01,0:08:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I never lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.85,0:08:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sparred with all of them, and\Nhere I am, still their commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.65,0:09:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if one of them does take\Nmy job, it'll probably be Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.91,0:09:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure am looking forward to this, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.47,0:09:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm curious to see what kind of moves\Nhelped you get past all those nights?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.33,0:09:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you will!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.77,0:09:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and get it kid this\Ntime I won't go easy on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.39,0:09:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.27,0:10:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.15,0:10:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blue Rose Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.37,0:10:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lend me your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.49,0:10:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Release Recollection?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.59,0:10:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now pay close attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.89,0:10:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The perfect weapon control art has\Ntwo stages, enhance and release.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.65,0:10:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enhance? Release?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.73,0:10:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, enhancing awakens part\Nof your weapon's memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.99,0:10:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The act causes a new attack to manifest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.15,0:10:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the releasing stage, you can\Nawaken all of your weapon's memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.41,0:10:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you can unleash\Nits most savage power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.77,0:11:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.23,0:11:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That explains Eldrie's win.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.55,0:11:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In its enhanced stage, it can get\Nlonger than normal, and then split.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.43,0:11:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then its release stage was\Nwhen it changed into a snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.31,0:11:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.31,0:11:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, you too should avoid\Nusing release for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.31,0:11:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.79,0:11:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you are not yet ready to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.93,0:11:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have only just learned of the art.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.39,0:11:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until you master it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.93,0:11:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you cannot control the power\Ngenerated by your weapon's memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.19,0:11:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially those of a\Ndivine object like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.27,0:11:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can harm you as much as your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.63,0:11:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're not careful, it will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.85,0:12:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never saw a swordsman toss\Nhis blade during a fight before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.45,0:12:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you come up with that trick yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.25,0:12:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.16,0:12:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My partner taught me that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.49,0:12:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The battlefield has lots of opportunities.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.37,0:12:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything can be a weapon or a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.01,0:12:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make the best of what you got. Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you might have gotten\Nthe upper hand this round,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.55,0:12:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's no way in\Nhell you're gonna beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.45,0:12:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Blue Rose Sword has two dormant\Nmemories, Eternal Ice and Rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.29,0:12:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I activate Eternal\NIce, it freezes everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.59,0:12:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'll show you what Rose can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.83,0:12:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blue Rose Bloom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.17,0:13:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.45,0:13:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Rose's bloom by absorbing the\Nlife of those trapped in the ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.83,0:13:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goddammit, you little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.55,0:13:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So is this your plan all\Nalong, killing the both of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.89,0:13:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not us, just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.21,0:13:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have an advantage over\Nme in every way except one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.37,0:13:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your total amount of life left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.07,0:13:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Based on your appearance, you became\Nan Integrity Knight in your 40s.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.79,0:13:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, your life value is lower than mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.93,0:13:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm younger and my life\Nvalue is near its peak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.71,0:13:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though you landed a hit, the life\NI have left is still higher than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.97,0:13:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I hoped anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.05,0:13:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kid, you don't know what\Nyou're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.35,0:13:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just said I became\Nan Integrity Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.15,0:13:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A knight's all I've ever been.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.09,0:13:56.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't have a life\Nbefore I was summoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.29,0:13:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's the part of you\Npeople I find so despicable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.95,0:14:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've forgotten who you used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.17,0:14:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're loyal to the Axiom Church\Nwithout knowing what it really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.19,0:14:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You act like you're champions of\Njustice, but you uphold corruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.15,0:14:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're here because the\NPontifex summoned you from heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.65,0:14:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.57,0:14:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.47,0:14:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the one who gave\Nyou the name Bercouli.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.57,0:14:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're human, just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.05,0:14:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bercouli.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.97,0:14:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my village, they tell stories\Nabout how much of a hero you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.61,0:14:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What stories?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.79,0:14:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.79,0:14:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've seen this sword before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.69,0:14:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I have. Somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.99,0:14:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.95,0:14:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.55,0:14:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was in the nest of the white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.59,0:14:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw it there after I killed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.51,0:14:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed the dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.27,0:14:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw its bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.33,0:14:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.69,0:15:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you say the one who killed it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.31,0:15:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dragon that protected the human realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.79,0:15:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one from your own legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.05,0:15:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember\Nanything about your past?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.17,0:15:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About who you were?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.23,0:15:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In Rulid, the village you founded and\Nwhere I was born, everyone knew about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.23,0:15:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Young or old, we looked\Nup to you as a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.93,0:15:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the Pontifex sealed\Naway your memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.05,0:15:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She turned you into the\Nfirst Integrity Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.49,0:15:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then came the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.85,0:15:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone from Fanatio\Nto Eldrie, even Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.05,0:15:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.03,0:15:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you became Integrity\NKnights, you had lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.71,0:15:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were human.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.89,0:15:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sealed away my memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.65,0:15:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just believe a\Nwild story like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:16:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But all that stuff I was told about\Nme being summoned from heaven And...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.39,0:16:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had my doubts...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.79,0:16:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.25,0:16:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.29,0:16:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't do. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.69,0:16:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't do at all, my dear commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.51,0:16:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely, good sir, you don't\Nplan to die on us like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.83,0:16:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be treason against her\Neminence, the lovely Pontifex.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she were awake to see you in\Nthis state, she would be livid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.75,0:16:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prime Senator Chudelkin, this\Nis a fight between swordsmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.71,0:17:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pig like you has no business here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.63,0:17:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After going so easy on this heretic,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.59,0:17:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have no business\Ncorrecting me, dear Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.17,0:17:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pray tell, why did you not\Nuse your sword's full power?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.95,0:17:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you could have slaughtered\Nthis loathsome brat
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.15,0:17:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before he opened his\Nslanderous little mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.51,0:17:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, you did not, and therefore committed\Ntreason against the glorious pontifics.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.61,0:17:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.55,0:17:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fought with everything I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.57,0:17:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.35,0:17:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lied to all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.15,0:17:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This kid ain't no assassin\Nfrom the Dark Territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.65,0:17:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And compared to an ugly piece\Nof shit like you... Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.41,0:17:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be silent or I'll rip off your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.93,0:17:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your information, my dear,\Nwe wouldn't have this problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.99,0:18:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you damned knights\Nweren't so damned useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.01,0:18:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, when her eminence awakes, you\Nknights will be thoroughly punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.55,0:18:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the very least, you and your precious\Nvice commander shall be reprocessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.69,0:18:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Re-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.83,0:18:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're talking out your ass again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.97,0:18:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.25,0:18:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deep Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.41,0:18:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Integrator Unit ID 001!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.71,0:18:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't need old farts like Number\NOne stinking up the place anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.31,0:18:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we have a much younger, more useful...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.37,0:18:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kitty-tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.21,0:18:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.31,0:18:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eugeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.53,0:19:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?\NHuh? Oh, no. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.89,0:19:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as the moon comes out, I think\Nwe can start climbing up the wall again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.19,0:19:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long as I can make spikes, it\Nshould go pretty easy from here on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.57,0:19:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no minions above us, and\Nthe others here ain't waking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.21,0:19:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.61,0:19:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides the lack of sacred power,\Nthe only other big problem is food.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.79,0:19:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you, but I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.15,0:19:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I think about how much further we\Ngotta go, my head starts spinning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.05,0:19:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you be any more of\Na disappointment? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.81,0:19:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether we miss a meal or two\Nis the least of our worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.01,0:19:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you are a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.87,0:19:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, technically,\NI still sort of am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.69,0:19:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might not act like it all the time,\Nbut I'm not even out of my teens yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.31,0:19:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't eat, my life goes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.97,0:19:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A problem you badass knights don't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.03,0:19:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such language.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.65,0:19:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even Integrity Knights get hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.81,0:19:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must eat or we lose life like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.71,0:19:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold on. Sorry. I was kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.23,0:20:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you get hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.97,0:20:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're as alive as anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.85,0:20:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of food, where\Nare Cardinal's snacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.97,0:20:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.25,0:20:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew I snagged some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.79,0:20:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.70,0:20:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dinner time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.17,0:20:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why in the world would you\Nstore your food in such a way?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.69,0:20:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.60,0:20:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just tap my pocket and there they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.29,0:20:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try it sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.51,0:20:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, I gotta get these ready to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.23,0:20:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.23,0:20:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate thermal element.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.69,0:20:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burst element?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.60,0:20:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you fool! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.49,0:20:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you use that art, you will burn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.47,0:20:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.17,0:20:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate thermal element.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.75,0:20:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aqueous element.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.95,0:20:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aerial element.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.73,0:20:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vortex shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.71,0:20:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.91,0:20:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.53,0:20:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, give me one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.37,0:21:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! No, no, no! I am joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.25,0:21:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hit the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.97,0:21:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for showing me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.51,0:21:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you could steam food\Nusing elements instead of a pan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.11,0:21:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you teach your little sis how to cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.29,0:21:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause Selka's really good at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.61,0:21:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.17,0:21:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That you have a little sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.69,0:21:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her name's Selka.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.85,0:21:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.83,0:21:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell you about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.43,0:21:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell you everything\NI know about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.05,0:21:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you'll believe\Nme, but it's worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.45,0:21:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.53,0:22:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, if I detect even a trace of deceit\Nin your words, I shall end your life.
